 #: system/settings/settings.xml
-#. Hades, label of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvaheadmode"; the core string #39987
-msgctxt "#31701"
+#. Hades, label of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvaheadmode"; the core string #59987
