+#. Hades: Help of the setting "subtitles.hadesbitmapsaturation" (core #59233)
+msgctxt "#52302"
 msgid "Makes the colours of picture-based subtitles (the kind on Blu-ray discs: PGS and VobSub) paler, if they are too vivid for you, such as the yellow of some 4K discs. 100 % leaves them exactly as they were made; 0 % makes them grey. Their brightness stays as it is. It works the same in SDR, HDR10 and Dolby Vision. Disc menus are not changed."
 msgstr "Hace más pálidos los colores de los subtítulos en forma de imagen (los de los discos Blu-ray: PGS y VobSub) si te parecen demasiado intensos, como el amarillo de algunos discos 4K. 100 % los deja exactamente como se hicieron; 0 % los vuelve grises. Su brillo no cambia. Funciona igual en SDR, HDR10 y Dolby Vision. Los menús del disco no cambian."
 
 #: system/settings/settings.xml
