 #: system/settings/settings.xml
-#. Setting label: the trim pass where Hades maps Dolby Vision to the display itself (core #41461)
-msgctxt "#33461"
+#. Setting label: the trim pass where Hades maps Dolby Vision to the display itself (core #61461)
